# .trivyignore
#
# CVEs accepted for the published fetchly image, consumed by the Trivy scan in
# .github/workflows/docker-build.yml. The scan already passes --ignore-unfixed,
# so anything listed here is a finding that HAS a fix available and is being
# accepted anyway - record why, and revisit it on the next release.
#
# Format: one vulnerability id per line, with the reason in a comment above it.
#
#   # torch pulls this transitively; not reachable from any code path fetchly
#   # executes, upstream fix expected in <version>.
#   CVE-0000-00000
